    "reference_values": "All nine literal t_pmat06 matrix entries are preserved for (2400000.5,50123.9999); off-diagonal checks retain the upstream 1e-14 scale. Additional matrices were generated by compiling the full exact pinned original C pipeline. Orthogonality and positive determinant are supplementary properties, not replacements for those references."
